translate italian adrian2_8e7751b4:

    # "In my social studies class, Adrian and I talk a bit before class starts."
    "Durante la lezione di scienze sociali, io e Adrian chiacchieriamo un po’ prima che inizi la lezione."

# game/Scenes/Adrian/Adrian2.rpy:12
translate italian adrian2_dfe32186:

    # gg "Have you played any Souls of War?"
    gg "Hai mai giocato a Souls of War?"

# game/Scenes/Adrian/Adrian2.rpy:13
translate italian adrian2_ce2ffb52:

    # pc "What is that, a computer game?"
    pc "Che cos’è, un videogioco?"

# game/Scenes/Adrian/Adrian2.rpy:14
translate italian adrian2_f421b58a:

    # gg "Yeah, man. It's great. I've been playing it like crazy the last couple of weeks."
    gg "Sì, amico. È fantastico. Ci sto giocando come un matto nelle ultime due settimane."

# game/Scenes/Adrian/Adrian2.rpy:15
translate italian adrian2_c7884527:

    # pc "Cool. I don't play a ton of games anymore."
    pc "Fico. Non gioco più molto ai videogiochi."

# game/Scenes/Adrian/Adrian2.rpy:16
translate italian adrian2_dff1d00f:

    # gg "You should check it out."
    gg "Dovresti provarlo."

# game/Scenes/Adrian/Adrian2.rpy:17
translate italian adrian2_9a1fce33:

    # gg "Hey, if you want to see what it's like, you could come over to my house and I could show you."
    gg "Ehi, se vuoi vedere com’è, potresti passare da me e te lo faccio vedere."

# game/Scenes/Adrian/Adrian2.rpy:23
translate italian adrian2_8c2be035:

    # gg "Great! Can you come over tonight?"
    gg "Fantastico! Puoi passare stasera?"

# game/Scenes/Adrian/Adrian2.rpy:24
translate italian adrian2_38aec589:

    # pc "Sure, I'll head over after work."
    pc "Certo, passo dopo il lavoro."

# game/Scenes/Adrian/Adrian2.rpy:25
translate italian adrian2_840b1f51:

    # gg "Okay, I'll text you my address."
    gg "Ok, ti mando il mio indirizzo via SMS."

# game/Scenes/Adrian/Adrian2.rpy:26
translate italian adrian2_7893f16a:

    # pc "Cool. Looking forward to it."
    pc "Fantastico. Non vedo l’ora."

# game/Scenes/Adrian/Adrian2.rpy:27
translate italian adrian2_d639582e:

    # gg "Me too, I can't wait."
    gg "Anch’io, non vedo l’ora."

# game/Scenes/Adrian/Adrian2.rpy:30
translate italian adrian2_c922aa63:

    # gg "Oh, okay. No big deal."
    gg "Oh, va bene. Non è un problema."

# game/Scenes/Adrian/Adrian2.rpy:34
translate italian adrian2_c27d3948:

    # "Ms. Welch starts talking then and puts an end to our conversation."
    "A quel punto la signora Welch inizia a parlare e mette fine alla nostra conversazione."

# game/Scenes/Adrian/Adrian2.rpy:35
translate italian adrian2_e63040ef:

    # "After that, nothing else interesting happens throughout the day and then it is time to go to work."
    "Dopo di che, non succede nient’altro di interessante per il resto della giornata e poi è ora di andare al lavoro."

